# CodeCharta analysis

[![Quality Gate Status For Analysis](https://sonarcloud.io/api/project_badges/measure?project=maibornwolff-gmbh_codecharta_analysis&metric=alert_status)](https://sonarcloud.io/summary/new_code?id=maibornwolff-gmbh_codecharta_analysis)

> CodeCharta by [MaibornWolff](https://www.maibornwolff.de)

## CodeCharta analysis tools

CodeCharta analysis tools generally follow the pipes and filters architecture principle.

### Importer

Components that import data from an external source, e.g. SonarQube, and generate visualization data.

| Source             | Project                                               |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| CodeMaat CSV       | [CodeMaatImporter](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/CodeMaatImporter/README.md) |
| generic CSV        | [CSVImporter](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/CSVImporter/README.md)           |
| SVN log            | [SVNLogParser](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/SVNLogParser/README.md)         |
| Git log            | [GitLogParser](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/GitLogParser/README.md)         |
| SonarQube          | [SonarImporter](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/SonarImporter/README.md)       |
| Source Code        | [SourceCodeParser](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/SourceCodeParser/README.md) |
| SourceMonitor CSV  | [SourceMonitorImporter](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/CSVImporter/README.md) |
| Source Code / Text | [RawTextParser](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/parser/RawTextParser/README.md)       |
| Tokei              | [TokeiImporter](https://github.com/MaibornWolff/codecharta/blob/main/analysis/import/TokeiImporter/README.md)       |

